		(at 141.45 78)
		(descr "QST QMA6100P, 3-axis accelerometer, LGA-12 (2x2x0.95mm, 0.5mm pitch). Pad geometry (LGA-12_L2.0-W2.0-P0.50-TL_QMA6100) pulled verbatim from JLCPCB/LCSC's EasyEDA component API (LCSC C2887190, the same manufacturer-verified footprint used for their PCBA service), not hand-estimated from the preliminary datasheet's low-resolution mechanical drawing. Pin 1 at top-left in this top-view orientation, numbered clockwise: 1-4 down the left edge, 5-6 across the bottom, 7-10 up the right edge, 11-12 across the top. Verify against the physical part before fab.")
